t border d-flex align-items-center gap-3 h-100 transition-all hover-shadow"><div class="rounded-2 p-2 bg-white border text-primary" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><i class="fa-solid fa-stethoscope"></i></div><span class="fw-semibold text-dark" style="font-size:0.88rem">Deployment Troubleshooting</span></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6"><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light border d-flex align-items-center gap-3 h-100 transition-all hover-shadow"><div class="rounded-2 p-2 bg-white border text-primary" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation"></i></div><span class="fw-semibold text-dark" style="font-size:0.88rem">502 / 503 Incident Recovery</span></div></div><div class="col-lg-3 col-md-4 col-sm-6"><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light border d-flex align-items-center gap-3 h-100 transition-all hover-shadow"><div class="rounded-2 p-2 bg-white border text-primary" style="width:36px;height:36px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center"><i class="fa-solid fa-layer-group"></i></div><span class="fw-semibold text-dark" style="font-size:0.88rem">SaaS Multi-Tenant Isolation</span></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5" style="background-color:#f8fafc"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Engineering vs Uploading</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-3" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Engineering Beyond Deployment: Architectural Resilience &amp; Reliability</h2><p class="text-muted" style="line-height:1.7">A production deployment is not simply: <code>Code ➔ Server ➔ Website Live</code>. A reliable production environment requires multiple infrastructure layers to work in perfect synchronization. When any single layer is misconfigured, critical failures manifest immediately.</p><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-white border border-danger-subtle mb-4"><div class="fw-bold text-danger mb-2 small text-uppercase"><i class="fa-solid fa-triangle-exclamation me-1"></i> Common Consequences of Unmanaged Deployments:</div><div class="row g-2 text-secondary" style="font-size:0.84rem"><div class="col-sm-6">❌ 502 / 503 / 504 Gateway Timeouts</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Database Connection Pool Exhaustion</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Exposed API Keys in Git History</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Container Crash Loops (OOMKilled)</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Broken SSL/TLS Certificate Chains</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ DNS Record TTL Misconfigurations</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Runaway Unoptimized Cloud Invoices</div><div class="col-sm-6">❌ Missing Automated Disaster Recovery</div></div></div><p class="text-secondary small mb-0">Digify Soft Solutions approaches deployment as a <strong>rigorous infrastructure engineering problem</strong>, not just a hosting task.</p></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="p-3 p-md-4 bg-dark rounded-4 border border-secondary border-opacity-25 shadow-lg"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 pb-3 mb-3 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-circle bg-danger" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-warning" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-success" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="text-white-50 font-monospace small ms-2">Production Architecture Flow</span></div><span class="badge bg-primary bg-opacity-25 text-info border border-primary border-opacity-25 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem">12-Factor Compliant</span></div><div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2"><div class="arch-flow-node text-center"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-users text-info"></i><span>Global End Users &amp; Client Traffic</span></div><div class="text-secondary" style="font-size:0.72rem">Browsers, Mobile Apps, REST &amp; GraphQL Consumers</div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node text-center"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-warning"></i><span>Anycast Edge DNS / Global CDN &amp; WAF</span></div><div class="text-secondary" style="font-size:0.72rem">Cloudflare / AWS Route 53 / Anti-DDoS Mitigation</div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node text-center"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-scale-balanced text-primary"></i><span>Load Balancer &amp; Reverse Proxy</span></div><div class="text-secondary" style="font-size:0.72rem">AWS ALB / Nginx / Traefik SSL Termination</div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="row g-2 w-100"><div class="col-6"><div class="arch-flow-node text-center h-100" style="border-color:rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.3);background:rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08)"><div class="fw-bold text-info" style="font-size:0.8rem"><i class="fa-brands fa-react me-1"></i> Web App</div><div class="text-white-50" style="font-size:0.7rem">Next.js / React SSR</div></div></div><div class="col-6"><div class="arch-flow-node text-center h-100" style="border-color:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.3);background:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.08)"><div class="fw-bold text-success" style="font-size:0.8rem"><i class="fa-brands fa-docker me-1"></i> API Service</div><div class="text-white-50" style="font-size:0.7rem">Node / Python / Go</div></div></div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node text-center"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center justify-content-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-database text-success"></i><span>Database Clusters &amp; In-Memory Cache</span></div><div class="text-secondary" style="font-size:0.72rem">PostgreSQL (PgBouncer) · MongoDB Atlas · Redis</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom"><div class="container py-4"><div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-5"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Hyperscale Platforms</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">AWS, Google Cloud &amp; Microsoft Azure Engineering</h2><p class="text-muted">We design and configure cloud environments matched to your application&#x27;s actual compute, memory, and scaling profile.</p></div><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="deliv-card"><div class="deliv-card-icon" style="background:#fff7ed;color:#ea580c"><i class="fa-brands fa-aws"></i></div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">Amazon Web Services (AWS)</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">Production workloads engineered with AWS Best Practices Framework across compute, network, and storage.</p><ul class="list-unstyled mb-4" style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#334155"><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-warning me-2"></i> <strong>EC2 &amp; ECS</strong> containerized Fargate clusters</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-warning me-2"></i> <strong>Route 53 &amp; CloudFront</strong> global edge CDN</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-warning me-2"></i> <strong>Application Load Balancers (ALB)</strong> &amp; ACM SSL</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-warning me-2"></i> <strong>RDS PostgreSQL / MySQL</strong> Multi-AZ failover</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-warning me-2"></i> <strong>VPC Subnets</strong>, NAT Gateways &amp; Security Groups</li></ul><div class="p-2 px-3 rounded-3 bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem"><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">Route 53</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">CloudFront</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">ALB</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-warning bg-opacity-25 text-warning">ECS Fargate</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-info bg-opacity-25 text-info">RDS</span></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="deliv-card"><div class="deliv-card-icon" style="background:#eff6ff;color:#2563eb"><i class="fa-brands fa-google"></i></div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">Google Cloud Platform (GCP)</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">Serverless container execution, managed SQL, and low-latency global network infrastructure.</p><ul class="list-unstyled mb-4" style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#334155"><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Cloud Run</strong> auto-scaling serverless containers</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Compute Engine</strong> VM hardening &amp; disk arrays</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Cloud SQL</strong> automated backups &amp; replication</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Artifact Registry</strong> secure container image storage</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Secret Manager &amp; Cloud Armor</strong> WAF defense</li></ul><div class="p-2 px-3 rounded-3 bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem"><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">Cloud DNS</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">Cloud LB</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-primary bg-opacity-25 text-info">Cloud Run</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-success">Cloud SQL</span></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-4"><div class="deliv-card"><div class="deliv-card-icon" style="background:#f0fdf4;color:#16a34a"><i class="fa-brands fa-microsoft"></i></div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">Microsoft Azure</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">Enterprise application deployment leveraging managed identities, microservices, and container apps.</p><ul class="list-unstyled mb-4" style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#334155"><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Azure Container Apps</strong> serverless microservices</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Azure App Service</strong> Linux/Node web hosting</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Application Gateway</strong> with WAF v2 protection</li><li class="mb-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Azure Database for PostgreSQL</strong> flexible server</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i> <strong>Managed Identity &amp; Key Vault</strong> secret isolation</li></ul><div class="p-2 px-3 rounded-3 bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25 d-flex flex-wrap align-items-center justify-content-center gap-1 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem"><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">Azure DNS</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-secondary bg-opacity-25 text-white">App Gateway</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-success">Container Apps</span><span class="text-secondary">➔</span><span class="badge bg-info bg-opacity-25 text-info">Azure DB</span></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5" style="background-color:#f8fafc"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Modern Full-Stack Engineering</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-3" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Vercel &amp; Next.js Production Architecture</h2><p class="text-muted" style="line-height:1.7">For modern Next.js applications (App Router, Server Actions, Server Components, API routes), Vercel separates deployments into <strong>Local</strong>, <strong>Preview</strong>, and <strong>Production</strong> environments. We configure isolated environment variables, automated PR verification, custom domains, and edge routing.</p><div class="row g-3 mb-4"><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-white border"><div class="fw-bold text-dark small"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-branch text-primary me-2"></i> Preview Staging</div><p class="text-muted small mb-0 mt-1">Live isolated URL for every pull request to test functional, API, and SEO regressions before merging.</p></div></div><div class="col-sm-6"><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-white border"><div class="fw-bold text-dark small"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-success me-2"></i> Sensitive Variables</div><p class="text-muted small mb-0 mt-1">Production secrets configured with Vercel Sensitive functionality to prevent accidental leakage in logs.</p></div></div></div><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-white border small text-secondary"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success me-2"></i><strong>Zero-Downtime Rollback:</strong> Instant instant-revert capability back to any previous deployment hash in seconds if a regression is detected.</div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="p-3 p-md-4 bg-dark rounded-4 border border-secondary border-opacity-25 shadow-lg"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 pb-3 mb-3 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-25 font-monospace"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-circle bg-danger" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-warning" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-success" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="text-white-50 small ms-2">Vercel GitOps Pipeline</span></div><span class="badge bg-primary bg-opacity-25 text-info border border-primary border-opacity-25 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem">Preview-to-Production</span></div><div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center gap-2"><div class="arch-flow-node"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-brands fa-github text-white"></i><span>GitHub Push &amp; Pull Request</span></div><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">git push</span></div><div class="text-secondary mt-1 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem">refs/heads/feature ➔ PR #42 Opened</div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node" style="border-color:rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.35);background:rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.08)"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2 mb-2"><div class="fw-bold text-info small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-flask-vial text-info"></i><span>Isolated Preview Deployment</span></div><span class="badge bg-info bg-opacity-25 text-info font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">pr-42.vercel.app</span></div><div class="row g-1"><div class="col-6"><div class="p-1 px-2 rounded bg-black bg-opacity-40 text-white-50" style="font-size:0.68rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-success me-1"></i> Functional Tests</div></div><div class="col-6"><div class="p-1 px-2 rounded bg-black bg-opacity-40 text-white-50" style="font-size:0.68rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-success me-1"></i> Database Sync</div></div><div class="col-6"><div class="p-1 px-2 rounded bg-black bg-opacity-40 text-white-50" style="font-size:0.68rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-success me-1"></i>SEO &amp; Headers</div></div><div class="col-6"><div class="p-1 px-2 rounded bg-black bg-opacity-40 text-white-50" style="font-size:0.68rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-success me-1"></i> Core Web Vitals</div></div></div></div><div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center my-1"><span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-success border border-success border-opacity-25 mb-1" style="font-size:0.68rem">PR Approved &amp; Merged</span><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div></div><div class="arch-flow-node"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-bolt text-warning"></i><span>Atomic Production Cutover</span></div><span class="badge bg-warning bg-opacity-25 text-warning font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">Zero Downtime</span></div><div class="text-secondary mt-1" style="font-size:0.72rem">Instant pointer swap to immutable release build hash</div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node" style="border-color:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);background:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.08)"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2"><div class="fw-bold text-success small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-globe text-success"></i><span>Global Anycast Edge Network</span></div><span class="badge bg-success font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">Active</span></div><div class="text-white-50 mt-1" style="font-size:0.72rem">digifysoft.in · Sub-50ms Global Edge Latency</div></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-2"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Immutable Containerization</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-3" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Production Docker &amp; Multi-Stage Builds</h2><p class="text-muted" style="line-height:1.7">We engineer lightweight, immutable, production-hardened Docker containers. Instead of bulky 1GB+ development images with root access, we build multi-stage alpine images running under non-privileged users with strict health-check directives.</p><div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2 mb-4" style="font-size:0.88rem"><div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary mt-1"></i><span><strong>Multi-Stage Builds:</strong> Build dependencies are stripped out, leaving only the compiled runtime (under 100MB).</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary mt-1"></i><span><strong>Non-Root User:</strong> Processes run under <code>USER node</code> or <code>USER appuser</code> to eliminate privilege escalation risks.</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary mt-1"></i><span><strong>Built-In Health Checks:</strong> Periodic probes automatically trigger container restart policies if memory leaks or hangs occur.</span></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6 order-lg-1"><div class="p-3 p-md-4 bg-dark rounded-4 border border-secondary border-opacity-25 shadow-lg"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 pb-3 mb-3 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-25 font-monospace"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-circle bg-danger" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-warning" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-success" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="text-white-50 small ms-2">Dockerfile.production</span></div><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem">Multi-Stage · Node.js 22</span></div><div class="terminal-code-box"><div class="text-secondary">// Stage 1: Build Dependencies</div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">FROM</span> <span class="text-light">node:22-alpine</span> <span class="text-info fw-bold">AS</span> <span class="text-warning">builder</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">WORKDIR</span> <span class="text-light">/app</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-light">package*.json ./</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">RUN</span> <span class="text-success">npm ci</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-light">. .</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">RUN</span> <span class="text-success">npm run build</span></div><div class="my-2 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25"></div><div class="text-secondary">// Stage 2: Minimal Production Runtime</div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">FROM</span> <span class="text-light">node:22-alpine</span> <span class="text-info fw-bold">AS</span> <span class="text-warning">runner</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">WORKDIR</span> <span class="text-light">/app</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">ENV</span> <span class="text-warning">NODE_ENV</span>=<span class="text-success">production</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">USER</span> <span class="text-light">node</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-white-50">--from=builder</span> <span class="text-light">/app/.next ./.next</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-white-50">--from=builder</span> <span class="text-light">/app/public ./public</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-white-50">--from=builder</span> <span class="text-light">/app/node_modules ./node_modules</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">COPY</span> <span class="text-white-50">--from=builder</span> <span class="text-light">/app/package*.json ./</span></div><div class="my-2 border-top border-secondary border-opacity-25"></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">EXPOSE</span> <span class="text-warning">3000</span></div><div><span class="text-info fw-bold">HEALTHCHECK</span> <span class="text-white-50">--interval=30s --timeout=5s</span> \</div><div class="ps-3"><span class="text-info fw-bold">CMD</span> <span class="text-light">wget --spider http://localhost:3000/api/health || exit 1</span></div><div class="mt-2"><span class="text-info fw-bold">CMD</span> [<span class="text-success">&quot;npm&quot;</span>, <span class="text-success">&quot;start&quot;</span>]</div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5" style="background-color:#f8fafc"><div class="container py-4"><div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-5"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">DevOps Automation</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Automated CI/CD Pipeline Engineering</h2><p class="text-muted">Replace risky manual FTP or SSH deployments with auditable, automated GitHub Actions pipelines.</p></div><div class="row g-4 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-7"><div class="p-3 p-md-4 bg-dark rounded-4 border border-secondary border-opacity-25 shadow-lg"><div class="d-flex flex-wrap justify-content-between align-items-center gap-2 pb-3 mb-3 border-bottom border-secondary border-opacity-25 font-monospace"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><span class="rounded-circle bg-danger" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-warning" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="rounded-circle bg-success" style="width:9px;height:9px"></span><span class="text-white-50 small ms-2"><i class="fa-brands fa-github text-white me-1"></i> .github/workflows/deploy.yml</span></div><span class="badge bg-success bg-opacity-25 text-success border border-success border-opacity-25 font-monospace" style="font-size:0.72rem"><i class="fa-solid fa-check me-1"></i> Passing</span></div><div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2"><div class="arch-flow-node py-2 px-3"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2"><div class="fw-bold text-white small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-code-commit text-info"></i><span>on: push (refs/heads/main)</span></div><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">SHA 8f2a1b</span></div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow my-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-black bg-opacity-40 border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="text-muted small font-monospace mb-2 text-uppercase" style="font-size:0.7rem;letter-spacing:1px">Continuous Integration Jobs (Parallel)</div><div class="d-flex flex-column gap-2"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2 rounded bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-light"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success"></i><span>1. Dependency Lockfile &amp; npm ci</span></div><span class="text-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.7rem">14s</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2 rounded bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-light"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success"></i><span>2. Static Analysis &amp; ESLint / Typecheck</span></div><span class="text-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.7rem">21s</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2 rounded bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-light"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success"></i><span>3. Automated Unit &amp; Integration Tests</span></div><span class="text-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.7rem">38s</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2 rounded bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-light"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success"></i><span>4. Security Vulnerability Scan (Trivy)</span></div><span class="text-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.7rem">19s</span></div><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between p-2 rounded bg-dark border border-secondary border-opacity-25"><div class="d-flex align-items-center gap-2 small text-light"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success"></i><span>5. Immutable Container Build &amp; ECR Push</span></div><span class="text-secondary font-monospace" style="font-size:0.7rem">49s</span></div></div></div><div class="arch-flow-arrow my-1"><i class="fa-solid fa-arrow-down"></i></div><div class="arch-flow-node py-2 px-3" style="border-color:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.35);background:rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.08)"><div class="d-flex align-items-center justify-content-between gap-2"><div class="fw-bold text-success small d-flex align-items-center gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-rocket text-success"></i><span>Zero-Downtime Production Cutover</span></div><span class="badge bg-success font-monospace" style="font-size:0.68rem">Deployed</span></div><div class="text-white-50 mt-1" style="font-size:0.72rem">Staging Smoke Test Verified ➔ Blue/Green ECS Service Swap Completed</div></div></div></div></div><div class="col-lg-5"><div class="deliv-card"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">Pipeline Capabilities Included</h5><ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#334155"><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success mt-1"></i><span><strong>GitHub Actions Workflows:</strong> YAML pipeline configurations committed directly to your repository.</span></li><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success mt-1"></i><span><strong>Branch Protection Rules:</strong> Require passing tests and peer review before merging into <code>main</code>.</span></li><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success mt-1"></i><span><strong>Encrypted Secrets Injection:</strong> Secure linkage between GitHub Secrets and cloud target credentials.</span></li><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-circle-check text-success mt-1"></i><span><strong>Rollback Automation:</strong> Instantly redeploy the previous green build if health checks fail.</span></li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row align-items-center g-5"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Zero-Leakage Architecture</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-3" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Environment &amp; Secret Management</h2><p class="text-muted" style="line-height:1.7">Hardcoding secrets or committing <code>.env</code> files to Git is the #1 cause of credential theft and unauthorized database access. We establish strict environment separation between Local, Staging, and Production.</p><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light border mb-3"><div class="fw-bold text-dark small mb-2">We Audit &amp; Isolate Sensitive Credentials:</div><div class="d-flex flex-wrap gap-2"><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">DATABASE_URL</span><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">JWT_SECRET</span><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">STRIPE_SECRET_KEY</span><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">REDIS_URL</span><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">SMTP_PASSWORD</span><span class="badge bg-secondary font-monospace">AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY</span></div></div><ul class="list-unstyled mb-0 d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size:0.86rem;color:#334155"><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-primary mt-1"></i><span><strong>Git History Scrubbing:</strong> We check your git commits for accidentally committed secrets using automated scanners.</span></li><li class="d-flex align-items-start gap-2"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved text-primary mt-1"></i><span><strong>Cloud Secret Managers:</strong> Integration with AWS Secrets Manager, GCP Secret Manager, or Vercel Sensitive Variables.</span></li></ul></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="p-4 rounded-4 bg-light border"><h5 class="fw-bold mb-3 text-dark">Environment Isolation Tier</h5><div class="d-flex flex-column gap-3"><div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 border"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1"><span class="fw-bold text-dark">1. Development Environment</span><span class="badge bg-light text-secondary border">.env.local</span></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Local mock databases, test Stripe keys, and development credentials strictly ignored by git.</p></div><div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 border border-warning-subtle"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1"><span class="fw-bold text-dark">2. Preview &amp; Staging Environment</span><span class="badge bg-warning-subtle text-warning-emphasis border border-warning-subtle">Staging Secrets</span></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Sandbox APIs, staging database clusters, and automated PR verification environment.</p></div><div class="p-3 bg-white rounded-3 border border-success-subtle"><div class="d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center mb-1"><span class="fw-bold text-dark">3. Production Environment</span><span class="badge bg-success-subtle text-success border border-success-subtle">Encrypted Vault</span></div><p class="text-muted small mb-0">Live production database credentials, encrypted cloud vault secrets, and restricted RBAC access.</p></div></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5" style="background-color:#f8fafc"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row g-4"><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="deliv-card"><div class="deliv-card-icon"><i class="fa-solid fa-network-wired"></i></div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">DNS, Domain &amp; SSL/TLS Configuration</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">A production application requires rock-solid domain and SSL infrastructure. We configure:</p><ul class="list-unstyled mb-4 d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#334155"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Complete DNS Management:</strong> A, AAAA, CNAME, TXT, CAA, and SRV records.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Subdomain Ingress:</strong> <code>api.domain.com</code>, <code>app.domain.com</code>, <code>cdn.domain.com</code>.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Email Preservation:</strong> Protect MX, SPF, DKIM, and DMARC records during website migrations.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-check text-primary me-2"></i> <strong>Strict SSL/TLS:</strong> Automated Let&#x27;s Encrypt / Cloudflare Edge certs with HSTS enforced.</li></ul><div class="p-2 rounded bg-light border small text-muted font-monospace">example.com ➔ A / AAAA / CAA / SSL Full (Strict)</div></div></div><div class="col-lg-6"><div class="deliv-card"><div class="deliv-card-icon" style="background:#fee2e2;color:#dc2626"><i class="fa-solid fa-shield-halved"></i></div><h4 class="fw-bold mb-3" style="color:#0f172a">Production Security Hardening</h4><p class="text-muted small mb-3">We never treat “the website loads” as equivalent to “the production infrastructure is secure.”</p><ul class="list-unstyled mb-4 d-flex flex-column gap-2" style="font-size:0.85rem;color:#334155"><li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-danger me-2"></i> <strong>Server-Level:</strong> SSH key authentication only, disable root login, UFW firewall, fail2ban.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-danger me-2"></i> <strong>Application-Level:</strong> Security headers (CSP, X-Frame-Options), CORS, rate limiting.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-danger me-2"></i> <strong>Cloud-Level:</strong> IAM least-privilege policies, security groups, private VPC database subnets.</li><li><i class="fa-solid fa-shield text-danger me-2"></i> <strong>Zero Public DBs:</strong> Databases accessible exclusively via private subnets or SSH tunnels.</li></ul><div class="p-2 rounded bg-light border small text-muted font-monospace">SSH: Port Changed + PubKey Only | UFW: Active | Root: Disabled</div></div></div></div></div></section><section class="py-5 bg-white border-top border-bottom"><div class="container py-4"><div class="row g-4 align-items-center"><div class="col-lg-6"><span class="text-primary fw-bold text-uppercase" style="letter-spacing:1.5px;font-size:0.8rem">Data &amp; Observability</span><h2 class="fw-bold mt-2 mb-3" style="color:#0f172a;font-size:2.2rem">Database Connectivity &amp; Live Observability</h2><p class="text-muted" style="line-height:1.7">Production databases require connection pooling to prevent server crashes under sudden traffic spikes. We implement PgBouncer for PostgreSQL, replica sets for MongoDB, and persistent Redis caching layers.</p><div class="p-3 rounded-3 bg-light border mb-4"><h6 class="fw-bold text-dark mb-2">Supported Data Systems:</h6><div class="row g-2 text-secondary" style="font-size:0.85rem"><div class="col-sm-6"><i class="fa-solid fa-database text-primary me-2"></i> PostgreSQL &amp; PgBouncer</div><div class=